  "body": "## What changed\n\nDesktop startup appends plain-text diagnostics to the platform configuration folder's `camcraft.log`.\nEach record synchronizes to disk before returning.\nStartup keeps the previous run's records.\nThe file keeps INFO diagnostics when terminal logging is off.\nGPU enumeration, candidate and selection records name the adapter, vendor, device, backend and driver.\nPanic and returned startup failures keep forced backtraces.\nCrash messages name the log file and backend flags to try.\nThe panic hook preserves the previous hook.\nThe CLI keeps its stderr-only initializer.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe desktop entry point installed only a stderr subscriber.\nA Windows launch without a terminal had no persistent diagnostics.\nAdapter descriptors discarded driver metadata.\nReturned startup failures had no persistent backtrace.\n\n## Tests\n\nThese six pins failed on unchanged production code and pass with the fix:\n\n- `desktop_startup_error_survives_without_a_terminal`\n- `desktop_startup_error_is_persisted_when_terminal_logging_is_off`\n- `desktop_startup_log_preserves_the_previous_run`\n- `desktop_panic_keeps_its_message_and_backtrace`\n- `startup_adapter_log_names_the_gpu_backend_and_driver`\n- `startup_gpu_refusal_names_backend_retry_flags`\n\n`desktop_log_open_failure_keeps_a_named_terminal_diagnostic` also passes.\nThe panic pin checks repeated initialization, the previous hook and INFO persistence with terminal logging off.\nAll ten mutations failed at runtime and passed after restoration:\n\n- Restore upstream's desktop entry point.\n- Restore upstream's GPU descriptor, refusal and bring-up code.\n- Omit the panic file write.\n- Omit the previous panic hook call.\n- Truncate the previous log instead of appending.\n- Apply the terminal's off filter to the file layer.\n- Omit the returned startup failure's backtrace.\n- Omit returned-error logging in main.\n- Omit backend retry hints.\n- Omit the stderr subscriber fallback after a log-open failure.\n\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed all 13 steps.\nSeparate `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` and `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed.\n`git diff --check upstream/main` passed.\nEvery diff hunk has a written justification outside the repository.\nThe decision record is `docs/decisions/2421-startup-log-uma.md`.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\n`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nValidation ran headlessly on Linux.\nWindows message boxes, physical GPU failures and survival of a full system lock were not exercised.\nFile synchronization follows `write_all` in the implementation; the tests do not simulate power loss.\nNo batch gate, release gate or browser build ran.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nPR #1798 touches `crates/ui/src/egui_app/shell_window.rs`.\nIt changes shell construction and capture state.\nThis PR changes `Shell::fail` and `refuse_dialog`.\nIt touches the same file, different function; whichever merges second refreshes.\nPR #2110 has merged, so this branch does not stack on it.\nThis branch starts from upstream/main `5f2c3bf4b`.\n\nEffort: medium (no escalation).\n\nChangelog: Desktop startup persists GPU adapter and driver diagnostics, panic and failure backtraces, and log-location and backend-retry guidance.\n\nFixes #2421\n\n\n## Startup error dialog screenshots\n\nThese are native Linux dialog captures from an isolated `rfd`/zenity harness.\nBoth use the same synthetic no-adapter error message.\nBefore uses the parent commit's exact dialog description, which has no log location.\nAfter calls production `camcraft_app::logging::failure_message` and shows the log location and backend retry instructions.\nThis capture does not exercise a physical GPU failure or Windows dialogs.\n\n![Before: startup error dialog without a log location](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/7c4fb88d69041c75aff90027164c92d3ab709f6b/2459/startup-dialog-before.png)\n\n![After: startup error dialog with log location and backend retry instructions](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/7c4fb88d69041c75aff90027164c92d3ab709f6b/2459/startup-dialog-after.png)\n",
